<title>POLAND: PBR JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.62 vs    2.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.47 vs    2.90</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 12.20 vs    7.14</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	22.64 vs   16.61</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.72 vs   18.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   23.36 vs   32.13</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 62.32 vs   56.77</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     132.75 vs  118.69</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
